            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "The critical takeaway: earning more money always results in more take-home pay. You will never lose money by entering a higher tax bracket. Only the income within that new bracket is taxed at the higher rate. Every dollar below that threshold is still taxed at the same lower rates."
